        "headline": "泰航TG-663波音787-9爬升時風擋出現裂紋 返航上海平安降落",
        "summary": "泰國航空波音787-9（註冊編號HS-TWA）執飛上海浦東往曼谷TG-663航班，爬升至約9,000英尺時因風擋裂紋停止爬升並放油，起飛約80分鐘後返航浦東平安降落。落地約13小時後該機仍停在地面，未傳出人員受傷或進一步損傷。",
        "headline_en": "Thai Airways TG-663 Boeing 787-9 returns safely to Shanghai after windshield cracks during climb",
        "summary_en": "A Thai Airways Boeing 787-9, registration HS-TWA, operating TG-663 from Shanghai Pudong to Bangkok, stopped its climb at about 9,000 feet after its windshield cracked. The aircraft dumped fuel, returned to Pudong and landed safely about 80 minutes after departure. It remained on the ground about 13 hours after landing; no injuries or further damage were reported.",
